    "removed_external_dependency": false,
    "rationale": "The upstream regression references the newly added .messages enum case, preventing buggy compilation. The compatible patch uses Mirror label verification and an InputMessage array cast. It also catches the original decode error and reports XCTFail at the test source location, retaining the original error text; this preserves failing behavior while avoiding XCTest's unlocated <EXPR>:0 diagnostic. The decoding operation, fixtures and assertions remain. Only testInstructionsTypeMessagesDecoding is designated as the regression selector; string/array tests remain in the full suite. Runtime and semantic equivalence require validation and LLM review."
